e one ticket reopened, or a reused number. The sources don't say, so please check it in the ticket system.\n  - The 5/4 digest calls the account \"Gideon's industrial account\". I read that as Vantorre Group, since it was reassigned to Gideon that day.\n- **Excluded as Mobility or other accounts:** #4812 (Vantorre Mobility, 3/10/2025 digest) and #PD-4402 (Quillfeather, 9/15/2025 digest).\n- **No ticket number in these Group items:** the 8/3 digest's Hartford appointment-board issue and Mateo's request for a procurement explanation, the 5/3 duplicate arrivals at door 14, and the cheat sheet's \"procurement question\" and \"corrected receipt attachment\".\n\nI only read #strategic-pod, #inc-vtg-hartford and the team-strategic digests, which you can all see. Older tickets that were never mentioned in those places won't be here."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1792159200.000126"}}
